### Prepare Metadata
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/ios/prepare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DreamApp",
  "bundle_id": "com.tshepo.dream",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "release_notes": "Initial build"
}

### Upload via URL
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/ios/upload
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="url"

https://example.com/dreamapp.ipa
--boundary--

### TestFlight
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/ios/testflight
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "beta_info": "v1 Test",
  "testers": ["qa@milkbox.ai"],
  "submit_external": true
}

### Submit for review
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/ios/submit
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bundle_id"

com.tshepo.dream
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Ready for review submission
--boundary--

### Check latest status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8089/ios/status/com.tshepo.dream
Accept: application/json
